# hub-pg-durability: two write-kill-restart rounds, the second with the server at synchronous_commit=off,
# so only the store's own per-transaction `on` keeps an acknowledged batch (tests/durability.rs).
# The step file is removed through `gr`: the test container creates target/hub-steps as root.
